om/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-04T18:51:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T20:46:59Z","closed_at":"2026-04-24T20:46:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.6.1 and 4.7 development\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable unknown - cpe:/o:nixos:nixos:26.05 #1-NixOS SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri Feb 27 21:05:10 UTC 2026 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1240P (16 threads) - 15.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nSelect the `SpringBoneSimulator3D` node, assign a new Curve to the `damping_curve` parameter under the `settings/0/radius` section, drag the curve up so it changes....\n\n<img width=\"2043\" height=\"615\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2666c490-5995-4517-82a4-503d69d3989a\" />\n\n...and the command window will be spammed with messages with each update.\n \n<img width=\"1576\" height=\"286\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8f4562b-8901-43c6-a2ec-27ec939f2c10\" />\n\nTo me it looks like the [void _make_joints_dirty(int p_index, bool p_reset = false);](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ee713ccb7cbaddf59f8258ed6663461779d00856/scene/3d/spring_bone_simulator_3d.h#L179) function is being accessed from [line 672](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ee713ccb7cbaddf59f8258ed6663461779d00856/scene/3d/spring_bone_simulator_3d.cpp#L672) using a `callable_mp()` that isn't handling the default values as defined in the prototype.  (I don't know how the rules are supposed to apply though.)\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee above.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n\n[skeleton-spring-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26483961/skeleton-spring-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118199/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118199/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}